{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1000_p", "source_sha256": "27556c4586208b1404d01a2864850cce5a5db4d72d5987799ff4fbe5b6899785", "ja": "（Cleaskyのリバイバル公演が終わってから、\n美也とエレナ宛てのファンレターが増えたな……）", "zh": "（Cleasky的复刻公演结束后，寄给美也和艾蕾娜的粉丝来信变多了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "25c19baefce8a65fbe10c6120213f56168f75a5e05fde4c04ef26ddf0c347a3d", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさま！\n今、ちょっといい？", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n现在方便说几句吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ca8a86b8ab3fbfa03309d130651e0a74e18722c12ddab592feeaf034bea3c8be", "ja": "お、エレナ、お疲れ様。\nいいけど、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "哦，艾琳娜，辛苦了。\n可以啊，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "4e17e61e89c6b55bfd85cdc16c4883630621d9671d998b18933de79ecdfac5a1", "ja": "あのね、ミヤと話し合ったんだけど、\nちょっとお願いがあって……", "zh": "那个呀，我和美也商量了一下，\n有点事情想拜托你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "bad72145cec1c530d6667add53b14cf0e2c90ac4cba9c303f4f4edaf7128d25c", "ja": "あのね、ファンのみんなに、\n手紙を書きたいなって思ってるノ。", "zh": "那个，我想给所有粉丝写一封信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1005_p", "source_sha256": "53c05bbf9d7f7cd0b3bc93ae24dbffd1dd4a4f1a9b0852a5271649d8bfdd522b", "ja": "手紙？", "zh": "信？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "aafab9186e74235f9ccd958a74ce8546d2b0124cdd379b016b52a4367549024d", "ja": "うん！　公演の後、ファンレターを\nいーっぱいもらったでしょ？", "zh": "嗯！演出结束后，收到了好多好多粉丝来信，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1007_018ele", "source_sha256": "a560feab31fcbe4ad1ea33302cf8833169af147ef0f6aead5cebf4bee36cdaf7", "ja": "ワタシもミヤも、すっごくうれしくて。それに、\nイベントのお悩みも、全部読めなかったから……。", "zh": "我和美也都特别开心。还有，活动中大家写来的烦恼，我们也没能全部读完……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "04b2b88579c7fec8ce659e2231c77473432972dd5310bd82e4c2deb3dfd7227a", "ja": "ファンレターとか、お悩みをくれたファンのみんなに、\nワタシたちからもお手紙したいナって！　でも……。", "zh": "我们也想给写来粉丝来信、向我们倾诉烦恼的大家写封信！不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1009_p", "source_sha256": "251d1caae856091e162dec108ed2e223ed0cc3ad2249deb8ba4c4f3ab39d08b5", "ja": "なるほど。とはいえ、\n全員に手紙を書くのは無理だしな……。", "zh": "原来如此。不过，要给所有人写信也不现实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1010_018ele", "source_sha256": "e2b660524a3ad392130656555e47e6f0ac963d66dfa84aacb51469dd8a2264d4", "ja": "そうなんだヨ～。{$P$}、\nどうしたらいいと思う？", "zh": "原来是这样呀～。{$P$}，你觉得该怎么办才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1011_p", "source_sha256": "fb85e6b9e6e9c028d6335fb66ad2dcbc9f87a2aeb1ee0ac905fdd997dee3b34d", "ja": "そうだな……。劇場のブログかどこかに、ふたりからの\n直筆のメッセージを載せるっていうのはどうだ？", "zh": "是啊……要不要在剧场的博客之类的地方，刊登两个人亲笔写的留言？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "c51e041e4c16710f3df6ec273821d970615844a1d724c54c5b811d0f06d1645e", "ja": "わぁ……！\n{$P$}、ありがとう！", "zh": "哇……！\n{$P$}，谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "acfd70efb1ff66932c3f01147d39175cf77e0f88e55379dd56fcbcd886f59195", "ja": "ブログだったら、遠くに住んでる\nファンのみんなにも、届くよネ！", "zh": "如果是博客的话，住在远方的粉丝们也能看到吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1014_p", "source_sha256": "cedd160a6c4a43ee48155053bcffe865faf10273799a94ac74ce6db9816d4c1a", "ja": "ああ。それに直筆メッセージはなかなか\n見られないから、みんなも喜んでくれると思う。", "zh": "啊。而且亲笔留言也很难看到，我想大家一定会很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "f8ea8409864e3de806429b2d0e046235f35ae5d58f412c4389522f213c804aef", "ja": "わかった！　ワタシとミヤのふたりで、\n心をこめて書くネ！", "zh": "知道啦！我和美也两个人会用心写的哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_018ele0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_018ele0293_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "83a09164d4ea93ff9a4cbf7005517be03e3d41efcd7583f0f7b2f9ca75e42577", "ja": "またいつか会えるといいネって……\nううん、絶対また会えるからって！　エヘヘ♪", "zh": "希望我们以后还能再见……不对，我们一定还能再见！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
